        {
          "page": "2",
          "section": "2. Methods",
          "quote": "The Al9.0Hf30.3NbxTa30.3-xTi30.3 (x = 0,10,15 at.%) RMPEAs were prepared by vacuum arc melting using pure metals Al, Hf, Nb, Ta, Ti (purity higher than 99.9 wt%). In order to ensure the uniformity of the alloy, the alloy ingot was turned over and melted for 6 times in an argon atmosphere, and the electric arc remained on the alloy ingot for more than 2 min during each melting process.",
